# Architecture

- Feature-first folders under `apps/web/src/features/<module>`.
- Business logic belongs in services / `packages/domain`, not in React components.
- UI must never import Prisma or access the database directly.
- Keep domain models independent of UI (DTO mapping at the boundary).
- One responsibility per module; shared cross-cuts go in `packages/*` or `components/shared`.
- Flow: UI → Server Action / Route Handler → Service → Repository → Prisma → PostgreSQL.
- Stock changes only via stock ledger services; balances update in the same transaction.
- Prefer Server Actions for first-party UI mutations; Route Handlers for health, external API, webhooks.
- Read `docs/architecture.md` and `docs/memory.md` before changing structure.
- Work phase-by-phase per `docs/phases.md`; do not jump ahead.
